{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Main_Capsule.png?t=1747926304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tWelcome to Werewolves Revenge, a\u00a0<strong>first person social deduction game</strong> where <strong>deception</strong>, <strong>strategy</strong>, and <strong>manipulation</strong> are your greatest weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/SocialDeductionImg.png?t=1747926304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Social_Deduction.png?t=1747926304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tUncover hidden roles and objectives through <strong>bluffing</strong>, <strong>strategic questioning</strong>, and <strong>keen observation</strong>. Vanquish all horrors before it's too late, or hunt down and\u00a0meticulously kill the villagers one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/RolesImg.png?t=1747926304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867320/extras/Roles.png?t=1747926304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience<strong>\u00a0100+ roles</strong>\u00a0in the standard set, each offering distinct abilities and win conditions,\u00a0<strong>5 factions</strong> in a constant and intricate struggle for power, and support for <strong>community roles</strong> and <strong>sets</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e </p><p class=\"b